  "description": "Over 55's Villa in great Victoria Park community<br/><br/>If you are over 55 years of age : Contact the Village Hub on 9361 2904 and ask for Ashlyn in the Housing Team during office hours if you would like to organise a property viewing.<br/><br/>Conveniently located at the river end of the Victoria Park strip, this rear 2 Bedroom plus study and 1 bathroom property has a single car lock up garage and is close to shops, cafe's, restaurants and transport. <br/>There are built in robes in both bedrooms, and the property also has small storeroom and a low maintenance garden in the courtyard!<br/><br/> As well as its highly desirable location this property is a great opportunity for someone who wants to be part of a wonderful community and live close to our Village Hub. (www.connectvictoriapark.org/). Only people aged 55 and over should apply.<br/><br/> <br/>Pets are negotiable with a pet bond.<br/><br/><br/><br/> The property is available immediately for the right tenant!",
